{"completed": true, "response": "他还是说不清自己到底想要什么，但之前那份想靠近的心情，在这里多了一点柔软和淡淡的甜意。因为他还没有把这份心情变成具体的要求，也没有确定自己一定要得到什么，所以靠近暂时只是一种可能，并不意味着他马上就要交出自己的空间。这样，他可以先感受到其中的温暖，而不必先得到理解和肯定，也不必先确认自己是安全的。这并不是说他已经想明白了，或者找到了兼顾两种愿望的办法，只是原本想靠近的心情变得更温暖了一些，而他到底想要什么，仍然没有定下来。", "metadata": {"session_handle": "264b49f9-0545-456e-ae89-c74c30143dc3", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T002807271475Z", "elapsed_seconds": 7.656, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T00:28:14.928020+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0f4f8661a3dd6b6edc2efa315cd4cb963777981d66d3ffca3024f987568bd2ec", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T002807271475Z", "files": [